65] and micro- and/or reduced-gravity [66-68] droplet combustion gained", "metadata": {"source": "PSI-117_Reports_Dissertation_Combustion Behavior Of Sub-Millimeter Sized Oxygenated And N-Alka.pdf", "page": 28}}